        "id": 199627,
        "name": "Yoshi348",
        "username": "Yoshi348",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/y/fbc32d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-28T02:35:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easy Mint. AZ put Subzero out early cause he didn't really have many useful cards, though any equipment he might have drawn would have gotten blown up three times over anyway, and Flesh of the Sun God made Thermal Shockwave useful without it. I dealt with Steel mainly by having Legacy use the old Evolution/Lead From the Front combo on projectile damage, so he wasn't able to accomplish much. One thing I'm surprised nobody else mentioned is that you eventually end up with an empty enviornment trash and and an Excavation in Ra's hand, which I used to create a new deck with Fiery Crystallizations to bathe enemies in fire to a hasty demise. It was almost as brutal as the old Volcanic Eruption trick.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
