        "id": 199628,
        "name": "carnilius",
        "username": "carnilius",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-28T17:48:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easy Mint. &nbsp;I was worried, as both of my practice games Steel brought out Arsonator, making his whole team immune to Fire. &nbsp;That, and a previous play of Imbued Fire, meant that he was invincible (didn't want to use my power to get rid of it, as that would mean not using Flesh of the Sun God). &nbsp;Thankfully, Arsonator never showed up in the One-Shot, so it was comparatively a cakewalk.</p>",
