      {
        "id": 199629,
        "name": "bolnerap",
        "username": "bolnerap",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-28T19:45:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Similar story to many folks. I mostly sat around twiddling my thumbs and reducing/preventing damage where I could while picking off Steel's minions, until the environment ran out of cards. Then I set up fire AOE damage from the environment with Excavation, played Imbued Fire, activated Flesh of the Sun God, and watched as the environment's AOE 6 fire damage, followed up by Ra's AOE 10 fire damage on a boosted Scorched Earth, leveled the entire field.</p>",
