      {
        "id": 199630,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-01T00:04:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easy Mint, basically the same way as Bolnerap. &nbsp;First game I've ever played that included Legacy in which he was basically irrelevant; this was Ra and Magmaria all the way. &nbsp;Flesh of the Sun God kept the heroes alive while double Fiery Crystalizations wiped the villain team (which Ra set up with Excavation). &nbsp;Scorched Earth helped, as did Seismic Defender. &nbsp;I ignored the nemeses; Ray Manta wanted to eat all the equipment, but Fiery Crystalization let Ra and AZ make great use of their equipment without playing it.</p>",
